  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internship and Entrepreneurship Programme 2026-2027 - The Programme &#xa0;aims to enhance youth employability and promote entrepreneurship in Mozambique. It will place 150 youth in structured, six-month interships with private sectpr companies in central and northerns provinces, while supporting 500 women and youth in the waste sector near Beluluane Industrial Park to establish income-generating businesses.</narrative>
